  "The workshop under the floor of the world: superposition, entanglement and the seams where the rendered universe is still being woven.": "L'atelier sous le plancher du monde : superposition, intrigue et les coutures où l'univers rendu se tisse encore.",
  "The world as the bee folds it, as the cat pours it, as the oak drinks it, as the whale sings it — each life a different lens grinding its own universe.": "Le monde tel que l'abeille le plie, le chat le verse, le chêne le boit, la baleine le chante — chaque vie un autre prisme qui meule son propre univers.",
