  "The bridge": "Le pont",
  "The field is generative, not additive — a lamp lights a thousand lamps and loses none.": "Le champ est génératif, non additif — une lampe en allume mille autres et n'en perd aucune.",
  "The state, not the effort, does the creating.": "C'est l'état, non l'effort, qui crée.",
  "The wave is set; the form follows.": "L'onde est lancée ; la forme suit.",
